.doc\">IDEA Part&nbsp;C FFY18 APR</a> (PDF, 590KB)</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ea177296-6df2-4511-8cb6-d34b28facf07\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%20Part%20C%20SPP-APR%20FFY2017.pdf\">IDEA Part C FFY17 APR</a> (PDF, 603KB)</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><strong>C-11: State Systemic Improvement Plan</strong>&nbsp;(SSIP)\r\n\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4c77f9e6-fc22-458c-8aac-7e097399c4b4\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ssip-c-2013.pdf\" title=\"Part C State Systemic Improvement Plan\">Part C State Systemic Improvement Plan</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 178KB) Published May 18, 2015.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>Theory of Action&nbsp;(PDF, 127KB) Published April 1, 2015.</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ae2b18ce-b023-403c-8bfc-1c5c1d6d6964\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/me_partc_SSIPII_3_31_16_final.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase II</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 207KB) Published March 31, 2016.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"19eeddbb-208d-41a0-b6c7-ef394115ec7c\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/me_partc_logic_33116_final.pdf\">Logic Model&nbsp;</a>(PDF, 256KB) Published March 31, 2017.</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"fe234fa1-0913-40e8-b92e-b18bb9a81aeb\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/me_partc_ssipiii_04_03_17__final_1.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 1</a> (PDF, 228KB) Published April 3, 2017.</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"3501f346-2e75-4014-9f9a-0c18b0c2bc44\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/mainepartcssipphaseiiiyear2_422018_final%20%286%29_0.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 2</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 228KB) Published April 2, 2018.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a7858c19-501f-4947-b766-338f570034a7\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/mainepartcssipphaseiiiyear2_evaluationmartix_422018_final%20%287%29.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 27KB) Published April 2, 2018</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"97cb4b91-7708-478c-8e15-51ed785dcfd3\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%20SSIP%20Phase%20III%2C%20Year%203_final.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 3</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 302KB) Published March 28, 2019.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d96697d9-6c9a-4925-9751-d4cecc1dfd19\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%202020%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix_final.doc.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 96KB) Published March 28, 2019</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"bc95caab-6334-4ab3-9d00-83d2039a7519\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%20SSIP%20Phase%20III%20Year%204_2019_final.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 4</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 347 KB) Published April 1, 2020.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6037095e-af98-41ec-a514-23d8627aa502\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%202020%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix_final.doc_0.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a>&nbsp;(PDF, 96KB) Published April 1, 2020</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c6c3eb05-6c83-4e12-918c-fcbc04328074\" filename=\"ME-C 2023 SSIP Evaluation Matrix.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-C%202023%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix.docx\">Evaluation Matrix</a> (Word, 51KB) Published April 24, 2023</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"8b4985bd-6080-46d5-8a60-ad7df674cdea\" filename=\"ME-C 2024 SSIP Evaluation Matrix_Posted 2.24.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-C%202024%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix_Posted%202.24.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a> (PDF, 205 KB) Published February 1, 2024</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/previous/index.html\">Previous Reports</a>. The Maine DOE make APR and SPP reports from the past eight years available to the public.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Public Reporting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Annual public reporting on the performance of each Part C and Part B, Section 619 CDS regional site located in the state on the targets in the state's State Performance Plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>IDEA Part B<br>\r\n\t<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"11b6545e-55e2-44a3-9ecf-5f4707e0eb39\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/FY21%20Part%20B%20Site%20Data.pdf\">Compliance Data 2020</a><br>\r\n\t<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"816a62a2-19d2-4a24-be1b-e4b764c0028b\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/2019%20Part%20B%20Compliance%20Data.pdf\">Compliance Data 2019</a><br>\r\n\t<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"75fa0138-8144-4379-9a6d-cd84c545964e\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/2018%20Part%20B%20Compliance%20Data.doc.pdf\">Compliance Data 2018</a><br>\r\n\t<a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a2c109b2-e964-46f3-8f52-94fcf4c1e513\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/2017%20Part%20B%20Compliance%20Data.doc.pdf\">Compliance Data 2017</a><br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partb-2016.docx\">Compliance Data 2016</a><br>\r\n\t&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li>IDEA Part C</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"30c26e8a-2e71-44b8-b408-39c197627194\" filename=\"FFY21 Part C Public Reporting Table.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/FFY21%20Part%20C%20Public%20Reporting%20Table.docx\">Compliance Data 2021</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"e774db7d-38e4-4535-9374-1463be0006f9\" filename=\"Public Reporting Table FFY20_0.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Public%20Reporting%20Table%20FFY20_0.docx\">Compliance Data 2020</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"685c3ce6-86b7-4edd-a6ad-ea6f6a8e53ec\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Public%20Reporting%20Table%20FFY19.docx\" title=\"Compliance Data 2019\">Compliance Data 2019</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a3679cfc-671c-444e-83f5-d1bd28625e57\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partc-2018_0.pdf\">Compliance Data 2018</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b1d1d592-6f5e-4ec8-8224-937b7e6db8cf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partc-2017_2.pdf\">Compliance Data 2017</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cd5383ca-76c5-4ddb-b059-700db2f16279\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partc-2016.pdf\">Compliance Data 2016</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Determination Letters</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>OSEP responds to the APR submitted by the state each year. OSEP provides an assessment of the performance and compliance level demonstrated in the report and categorizes it in one of four possible determinations: meets requirements, needs assistance, needs intervention or needs substantial intervention. The determination letters and response tables for all years of the SPP are on the U.S. Department of Education website:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"25dc20fb-a833-4f2d-917d-320b84b13a9e\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-aprltr-2020b.pdf\">Part B SPP &amp; APR Letters</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Part C Determination Letters</li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"623f8d7d-f1c2-457e-889d-9ccae4d59aee\" filename=\"ME-C 2022 OSEP Determination Letter.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-C%202022%20OSEP%20Determination%20Letter.pdf\">Part C Determination Letter 2022</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f17f26ba-3242-4fa2-b837-9e25535706f2\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME%20Part%20C%20FFY19%20Determination%20Letter.pdf\">Part C Determination Letter 2021</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7f25d35e-6dad-457f-ab13-71da4e933bcb\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-aprltr-2020c_0_0.pdf\">Part C Determination Letter 2020</a></li>\r\n\t<li>LEA Determination Letters\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2016.html\"><u>Federal Fiscal Year 2016 (2016-17)</u></a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2015.html\"><u>Federal Fiscal Year 2015 (2015-16)</u></a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2014.html\"><u>Federal Fiscal Year 2014 (2014-15)</u></a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2013.html\"><u>Federal Fiscal Year 2013 (2013-14)</u></a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2012.html\"><u>Federal Fiscal Year 2012 (2012-13)</u></a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">The State Performance Plan (SPP) is designed to evaluate the state's efforts to implement the requirements and purposes of Part B and Part C, respectively, and to describe how the state will improve its implementation. Each state is required to report annually to the public and to the Office of Special Education Programs on each local education agency's and Part C program's performance on the targets in the SPP through an Annual Performance Report (APR).</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/TheGeneralSupervisionSystem013015.pdf\">Introduction: General Supervision System</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/ProfessionalDevelopmentSystem013015_jg%20(2).pdf\">Introduction: Professional Development System</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>B-17: State Systemic Improvement Plan</strong>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/dataanalysis.pdf\