>Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 1</a> <span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published April 3, 2017.</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/mainepartcssipphaseiiiyear2_422018_final%20%286%29_0.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 2</a>&nbsp;<span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published April 2, 2018.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/mainepartcssipphaseiiiyear2_evaluationmartix_422018_final%20%287%29.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a>&nbsp;<span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published April 2, 2018</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%20SSIP%20Phase%20III%2C%20Year%203_final.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 3</a>&nbsp;<span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published March 28, 2019.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%202020%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix_final.doc.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a>&nbsp;<span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published March 28, 2019</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li class=\"doe-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%20SSIP%20Phase%20III%20Year%204_2019_final.pdf\">Part C SSIP Phase III, Year 4</a>&nbsp;<span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published April 1, 2020.\r\n\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Maine%202020%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix_final.doc_0.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a>&nbsp;<span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published April 1, 2020</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-C%202023%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix.docx\">Evaluation Matrix</a> <span class=\"doe-chip\">Word</span> Published April 24, 2023</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-C%202024%20SSIP%20Evaluation%20Matrix_Posted%202.24.pdf\">Evaluation Matrix</a> <span class=\"doe-chip\">PDF</span> Published February 1, 2024</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/previous/index.html\">Previous Reports</a>. The Maine DOE make APR and SPP reports from the past eight years available to the public.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"public-reporting\"><h2>Public Reporting</h2></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Annual public reporting on the performance of each Part C and Part B, Section 619 CDS regional site located in the state on the targets in the state's State Performance Plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>IDEA Part B<br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/FY21%20Part%20B%20Site%20Data.pdf\">Compliance Data 2020</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span><br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/2019%20Part%20B%20Compliance%20Data.pdf\">Compliance Data 2019</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span><br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/2018%20Part%20B%20Compliance%20Data.doc.pdf\">Compliance Data 2018</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span><br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/2017%20Part%20B%20Compliance%20Data.doc.pdf\">Compliance Data 2017</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span><br>\r\n\t<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partb-2016.docx\">Compliance Data 2016</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span>\r\n\t&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li>IDEA Part C</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/FFY21%20Part%20C%20Public%20Reporting%20Table.docx\">Compliance Data 2021</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Public%20Reporting%20Table%20FFY20_0.docx\">Compliance Data 2020</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Public%20Reporting%20Table%20FFY19.docx\" title=\"Compliance Data 2019\">Compliance Data 2019</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partc-2018_0.pdf\">Compliance Data 2018</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partc-2017_2.pdf\">Compliance Data 2017</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/partc-2016.pdf\">Compliance Data 2016</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"determination-letters\"><h2>Determination Letters</h2></div>\r\n\r\n<p>OSEP responds to the APR submitted by the state each year. OSEP provides an assessment of the performance and compliance level demonstrated in the report and categorizes it in one of four possible determinations: meets requirements, needs assistance, needs intervention or needs substantial intervention. The determination letters and response tables for all years of the SPP are on the U.S. Department of Education website:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-aprltr-2020b.pdf\">Part B SPP &amp; APR Letters</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li>Part C Determination Letters</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-C%202022%20OSEP%20Determination%20Letter.pdf\">Part C Determination Letter 2022</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME%20Part%20C%20FFY19%20Determination%20Letter.pdf\">Part C Determination Letter 2021</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ME-aprltr-2020c_0_0.pdf\">Part C Determination Letter 2020</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">PDF</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action\">LEA Determination Letters\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2016.html\">Federal Fiscal Year 2016 (2016-17)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2015.html\">Federal Fiscal Year 2015 (2015-16)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2014.html\">Federal Fiscal Year 2014 (2014-15)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2013.html\">Federal Fiscal Year 2013 (2013-14)</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/specialed/support/spp/leadeterminations2012.html\">Federal Fiscal Year 2012 (2012-13)</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["2 section headers — too few for a contents list.","513 words with no section headers at all — the biggest single improvement available here."],"decisions":[{"id":"blockhead","on":true,"label":"Turn the headings into section headers","why":"2 headings are plain text where every other page uses a section header, so the page reads as one continuous wall instead of parts.","value":"2 sections"},{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"28 links on this page open a file — 21 PDF, 7 Word — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"28 links"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"6 list items open with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"6 items"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"The State Performance Plan (SPP) is designed to evaluate the state's efforts to implement the requirements and purposes of Part B and Part C, respectively, and to describe how the state will improve its implementation. Each state is required to report annually to the public and to the Office of Special Education Programs on each local education agency's and Part C program's performance on the targets in the SPP through an Annual Performance Report (APR)."}],"mechanical":["u tags unwrapped: 26","drupal entity attrs stripped: 93","file sizes removed: 16","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","action links marked: 25","format labels chipped: 15","space moved out of a link: 1"],"findings":[{"name":"bullet-holding-only-a-sublist","n":1,"eg":["empty bullet before a sublist"]}],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/learning/cds/stateperformance","title":"State Performance Plan","changed":"2026-04-06T23:19:19+00:00","words":513,"bytes":13991,"fixes":["u tags unwrapped: 26","drupal entity attrs stripped: 93","file sizes removed: 16","line breaks at the edge of a block removed: 1","action links marked: 25","format labels chipped: 15","space moved out of a link: 1"],"flags":["no section-header device"],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":2,"t":"Public Reporting","bh":false},{"l":2,"t":"Determination Letters","bh":false}],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":0,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":0,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":0,"videos":0,"images":0,"b